                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "The row opens in place onto its presets, the console's pick-one for bare tokens \u2014 the same drawer LOOP \/ loop-output opens. A tap answers the question, so it also closes it. The choice set is the one the Settings page already offers; two surfaces disagreeing about which lengths exist is a bug nobody finds until a rig is set up on one and played from the other."
